09:15.260 --> 09:19.260
So we have the order ID 101 and the order status delivered.

09:19.260 --> 09:22.380
So the total sales of this going to be ten plus 20.

09:22.420 --> 09:23.900
And we're going to have 30.

09:24.100 --> 09:28.380
The next window going to be the same product but with different status.

09:28.380 --> 09:30.820
